Package: GeoPathSampleR
Title: Posterior Sampling of Geolocator Paths
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Raphaël", "Nussbaumer", , "rafnuss@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-8185-1020"))
Author: Raphaël Nussbaumer [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Raphaël Nussbaumer <rafnuss@gmail.com>
Description: Reconstruct stationary animal trajectories from geolocation
    likelihood maps using a Gibbs sampler with movement priors. Provides
    prepared sampler inputs, posterior path summaries, and sampling
    diagnostics for GeoPressureR tag objects.
License: GPL (>= 3) + file LICENSE
